---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Why was the sanctuary opened?"
  description="Why was the sanctuary opened? - Find out more in our FAQs"
  heroImage="/images/khao-sok-hero-cottages.jpg"
  heroTitle="Why was the sanctuary opened?"
  heroSubtitle="Khao Sok National Park · Field Answer"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Faq Items", "href": "/faq-items/"}, {"label": "Why Was The Sanctuary Opened", "href": "/faq-items/why-was-the-sanctuary-opened/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Firstly, it is not a sanctuary it is a conservation / rehabilitation center.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The aim of the center is to support <strong>rehabilitation of DOMESTIC elephants</strong> in Thailand.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The center was opened as a means of <strong>funding their veterinary hospital</strong> and clinic needs.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>They offer f<strong>ree elephant health care</strong> and advice to <strong>any owners of domestic elephants</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Injured or sick elephants <strong>can stay at the center for an extended period,</strong> until they are returned to their owners, adopted by someone else OR surrendered to the center permanently.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><strong>All of the funding</strong> for running the center, paying staff and running the hospital is <strong>generated through tourism</strong> tours to the conservation center.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
